| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| Injects money         | More cash in the system                    |
| Lowers interest rates | Makes borrowing cheaper                    |
| Boosts asset prices   | Stocks, crypto, and real estate often rise |
| Increases inflation   | Too much QE for too long = prices go up    |

